{
  "_doc": [
    "keybordy MP layout: the single source for pcb/macropad/build.py, cad/, the firmware header (layout/gen.py) and the host editor.",
    "Origin is the top-left corner of the key field, x right, y toward the user (KiCad orientation). U = 19.05 mm.",
    "keys[].x/y/w/h are in u (top-left corner and size, KLE style). Every other position is in mm, as the part's centre.",
    "matrix: diodes COL2ROW, rows are driven LOW one at a time, columns read with pull-ups. Encoder pushes sit in matrix row 4.",
    "Change pins in layout/pins.json, then `just mp-gen` and `just mp-lint`."
